fio                 # ergon speedtest disk (ERGON-115)
speedtest-cli       # ergon speedtest net (ERGON-115); Ookla's own binary is AUR-only
gnome-keyring       # Secret Service for Chromium/Electron apps (Discord, VS Code): ERGON-64.
